==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|sa|उपनिषद्}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of a set of authorless [[Hindu]] [[religious]] and [[philosophical]] [[text]]s considered to be an early source of the religion, found mostly as the concluding part of the [[Brahmana|Brahmanas]] and in the [[Aranyaka|Aranyakas]].

